SELECT gen_random_uuid(), 'page', 299, 'about', 'Details', 'RESUME Sayantan Chakraborty Manikpur,Manashbhumi PO.Italgacha North 24 Parganas, Kolkata – 700079 Email: c.sayantan@rediffmail.com Alt Email: sayantan.chakraborty@gmx.us Phone: Res. – (033) 25129929, Mob- +91-9477320851 Work Experience:  Total Experience : 13 months  I worked for Karshan…', '{"type":"none"}'::jsonb, '[{"type":"quote","text":"RESUME\nSayantan Chakraborty\nManikpur,Manashbhumi\nPO.Italgacha\nNorth 24 Parganas,\nKolkata – 700079\nEmail: c.sayantan@rediffmail.com\nAlt Email: sayantan.chakraborty@gmx.us\nPhone: Res. – (033) 25129929,\nMob- +91-9477320851\nWork Experience:\n Total Experience : 13 months\n I worked for Karshan Technologies Private Limited ( Oracle Application DBA EBS R12 and 11i) as program associate from 16th September 2010 to till date.\n I worked for Conacent Consulting Private Limited as Oracle Application DBA (EBS R12 from 17th September 2009 to 11th September 2010 as Trainee.\nKEY SKILLS:\n Managing HP StorageWorks Enterprise Virtual Array\n Managing HP StorageWorks XP (External Storage )\n Oracle 10gR2\n Oracle Application 11i and R12\n Backup, Recovery, RMAN (Data guard)\n HP-UX 11iv2 (11.23 i86 64 bit)\n EBS R12RUP 6/R12RUP4/11i implementation and support\n OEL 5.4 and 5.6\nOBJECTIVES:\nTo work in a progressive organization in a growing team and utilize my technical ability to the\nfullest extent and contribute to the overall growth of the organization.\nEDUCATIONAL QUALIFICATION:\n M.C.A. from West Bengal University of Technology. In 2009 with 7.79 (DGPA)\n Graduate with B. Sc. (Gen.) from University of Calcutta in 2006 with 47%.\n Passed X11th Standard from West Bengal Council of Higher Secondary Education in 2001 with 52.3%.\n Passed Xth Standard from West Bengal Board of Secondary Education in 1999 with 65.375%.\nTRAINING AND PROJECTS:\n Support Project: I am assigned to a support project collaborating with Karshan Technologies Ltd. and HCL at the Data center of Kolkata Municipal Corporation. Their architecture is Data guard and the platform is HP-UX from 22nd September 2010 to 26th December 2011 with EBS R12 DB version 10.2.0.4.0. Reporting Person : project manager Mr.Joydeep Kar,program consultant Mr.Anshuman Bose and project manager Mr.Subrata Sarkar (from HCL infosystems).\n support project I am assigned to a support project of Karshan Technology Ltd. at Lagan Engineering co ltd as apps DBA for cloning and recovery planing. EBS 11i. Reporting Person : project manager Mr.Jaydeep kar\n Implementation Project: I was assigned to handle the responsibility of oracle Apps DBA at Webbindia Pvt ltd from conacent consulting pvt ltd from 17 june 2010 to 19 August 2010.Reporting Person : project manager Mr.Saumo Sarkar\n Current Training:\n• Managing HP StorageWorks XP 1 configuration and management 5-day (H6773S) from 13th June to 17th June 2011 (40 hours) at HP Education And Training.\n• Managing HP StorageWorks Enterprise Virtual Array configuration and management 5-day (U4879S) from 9th May to 13th May 2011 (40 hours) at HP Education And Training.\n• I have completed a training program on Oracle 10g pl/sql from SQL Star International Limited under the supervision of Saroj Behera 16th March 16, 2011 to 3rd April 2011 (40 hrs).\n• A training program is completed on Oracle 9i OCA fundamental and oracle 10g OCP (DBA Track) from Everonn Education Limited under the supervision of Suprio Das.\nACHIVEMENTS:\n 1z0-052 OCA 11g DBA (appearing)\n HP-UX CSA 11iv3 (HP0-P20) (appearing)\n TEO-121 Teradata Certified Professional (appearing)\nLEISURE TIME INTEREST:\n Reading Linux Magazine AND Listening to music, Playing chess.\nPERSONAL PROFILE:\nFather’s Name : Krishnananda Chakraborty\nDate of Birth : 08/07/1982\nSex : Male\nMarital Status : Single\nNationality : Indian\nCurrent Salary : 0.96 lakhs p.a.\nRelocation : Any location and as per requirement\nTHANKING YOU"}]'::jsonb,
  NULL, 'csayantan', '{}'::text[], '{}'::text[], '{"title":"Details","description":"RESUME Sayantan Chakraborty Manikpur,Manashbhumi PO.Italgacha North 24 Parganas, Kolkata – 700079 Email: c.sayantan@rediffmail.com Alt Email…","canonical":"https://cadentic.dev/about","noindex":false}'::jsonb, 'draft', NULL,
