SELECT gen_random_uuid(), 'page', 3, 'rman-backup-by-catalog-database', 'rman-backup-by-catalog-database', 'the backup is taken in win xp system connected to db orc and orcl. catalog database creation Microsoft Windows XP [Version 5.1.2600] (C) Copyright 1985-2001 Microsoft Corp. C:\Documents and Settings\admin>sqlplus sys/system as sysdba SQL*Plus: Release 10.2.0.1.0 – Production on Sat Apr 3 10:45:16…', '{"type":"none"}'::jsonb, '[{"type":"paragraph","text":"the backup is taken in win xp system connected to db orc and orcl."},{"type":"html","html":"<p><strong>catalog database creation</strong></p>"},{"type":"quote","text":"Microsoft Windows XP [Version 5.1.2600]\n(C) Copyright 1985-2001 Microsoft Corp.\nC:\\Documents and Settings\\admin>sqlplus sys/system as sysdba\nSQL*Plus: Release 10.2.0.1.0 - Production on Sat Apr 3 10:45:16 2010\nCopyright (c) 1982, 2005, Oracle. All rights reserved.\nConnected to:\nOracle Database 10g Enterprise Edition Release 10.2.0.1.0 - Production\nWith the Partitioning, OLAP and Data Mining options\nSQL> select name from V$database;\nNAME\n---------\nORCL\nSQL> CREATE USER rman IDENTIFIED BY cat\n2 TEMPORARY TABLESPACE temp\n3 DEFAULT TABLESPACE users\n4 QUOTA UNLIMITED ON users\n5 /\nUser created.\nSQL> GRANT RECOVERY_CATALOG_OWNER TO rman\n2 ;\nGrant succeeded.\nSQL>"},{"type":"html","html":"<p><strong>orc is kept at mount state</strong></p>"},{"type":"quote","text":"C:\\Documents and Settings\\admin>sqlplus sys/system@orc as sysdba\nSQL*Plus: Release 10.2.0.1.0 - Production on Sat Apr 3 11:17:58 2010\nCopyright (c) 1982, 2005, Oracle. All rights reserved.\nConnected to:\nOracle Database 10g Enterprise Edition Release 10.2.0.1.0 - Production\nWith the Partitioning, OLAP and Data Mining options\nSQL> startup mount;\nORA-01081: cannot start already-running ORACLE - shut it down first\nSQL> shut immediate;\nDatabase closed.\nDatabase dismounted.\nORACLE instance shut down.\nSQL> startup mount;\nORA-12514: TNS:listener does not currently 