SELECT gen_random_uuid(), 'page', 0, 'oracle-apps-r12', 'oracle apps R12', 'I am currently working as oracle apps DBA conacent consulting pvt Ltd. and sent to an implementation. Here i am sharing my working days experiences here. How to get the details for an instance? 468311.1 – Script to find Apache, Java, JRE, Forms version for Oracle E-Business Suite R12…', '{"type":"none"}'::jsonb, '[{"type":"html","html":"<p>I am currently working as oracle apps DBA <a href=\"http://www.conacent.com\">conacent consulting pvt Ltd.</a><br>\nand sent to an implementation.</p>"},{"type":"html","html":"<p>Here i am sharing my working days experiences here.<br>\n<strong><br>\nHow to get the details for an instance?<br>\n</strong></p>"},{"type":"quote","text":"468311.1 – Script to find Apache, Java, JRE, Forms version for Oracle E-Business Suite R12 .\n[demoap@demo ~]$ Instancedetails_R12.sh\nScript Started\nWed Jun 23 13:29:23 IST 2010\n*****Apache Version*****\nServer version: Oracle-Application-Server-10g/10.1.3.0.0 Oracle-HTTP-Server\nServer built: Aug 29 2006 00:19:58\n*****perl version******\nThis is perl, v5.8.3 built for i686-linux-thread-multi\n******Java Version******\njava version “1.5.0_08”\nJava(TM) 2 Runtime Environment, Standard Edition (build 1.5.0_08-b03)\nJava HotSpot(TM) Server VM (build 1.5.0_08-b03, mixed mode)\n*****Client JRE version*****\nsun_plugin_version=1.5.0_10\n*****Forms Version*****\nForms 10.1 (Form Compiler) Version 10.1.2.0.2 (Production)\n*****PL/SQL Version****\nPL/SQL Version 10.1.0.5.0 (Production)\n****Forms Communication Mode****\nserverURL=/forms/lservlet\nIf the serverURL parameter has no value then Forms is implemented in socket mode else it is servlet\nScript Completed Successfully and it has generated the file zzdemo.webbindia.com_062310.1329.txt file in current directory\nScript completed\nWed Jun 23 13:29:24 IST 2010\n[demoap@demo ~]$"},{"type":"html","html":"<p><strong><br>\nHow to run a report from terminal with trace file?<br>\n</strong></p>"},{"type":"quote","text":"[demoap@demo ~]$$INST_TOP/ora/10.1.2/bin/appsrwrun.sh userid=apps-user/apps-password report=$ONT_TOP/reports/US/WILPACKSLIP.rdf desformat=$FND_TOP/reports/HPL desname=WIPPACKSLIP.pdf destype=file batch=yes traceopts=traceall tracefile=./ddr5.trc P_DELV_ID=8022"},{"type":"quote","text":"frmcmp_batch module=JAINIBOE.fmb output_file=$JA_TOP/forms/US/JAINIBOE.fmx\nuserid=apps/"}]'::jsonb,
