SELECT gen_random_uuid(), 'page', 10, 'managing-and-configuring-hp-storagework-eva-8400', 'HP StorageWork EVA 8400', 'Overview Overview Want to tune your storage for the most visible applications in your complex enterprise environment? EVA provides designed-in virtualization to support your most critical applications as well as your bulk storage needs. HP StorageWorks 6400/8400 Enterprise Virtual Array…', '{"type":"none"}'::jsonb, '[{"type":"html","html":"<p><strong>Overview</strong></p>"},{"type":"quote","text":"Overview\nWant to tune your storage for the most visible applications in your complex enterprise environment? EVA provides designed-in virtualization to support your most critical applications as well as your bulk storage needs.\nHP StorageWorks 6400/8400 Enterprise Virtual Array automatically improves performance by placing data across more disk drives with tiered storage and tightly integrates replication when using highly visible software applications. The ease of management using HP StorageWorks Command View Software results in less time spent on maintenance and administrative intervention. Higher capacity utilization provides improved performance and manageable storage in a more consolidated environmental footprint.\nThe EVA6400/8400 allows you to virtualize everything and seamlessly provision your storage when growing your applications. Add virtual servers and EVAs to dynamically build a complete virtualized IT environment—virtual storage for virtual servers tuned for your environment.\nWhat’s new\n• Support for 200 GB and 400 GB Solid State Drives, for superior performance in critical random IO environments.\nFeatures\nTune Business Application Environments\n• Adapts to improve performance by placing data across more spindles and automatically re-leveling when new storage is added. EVA solutions tightly integrate local and remote replication with highly visible software applications. EVA offers tiered storage for the most effective use of storage dollars.\n• Allows IT to focus on innovation by reducing the amount of management resources needed to support, provision and maintain your storage environment when compared to traditional storage. Expanding and shrinking data files is as easy as a few mouse clicks resulting in less administrative intervention.\n• There is no need to pre-allocate storage capacity due to the management burden imposed by a traditional storage architecture. With the EVA’s easy management you can add disks when you want and manage disk capacity and utilization with Dynamic Capacity Management Software.\n• EVA offers Business Copy EVA and Continuous Access EVA Software for local and remote replication needs. The EVA solution improves data availability and business agility and supports business continuance and disaster tolerant environments for your key business applications.\nThe Best Array for Virtualized IT Environments\n• The EVA allows you to seamlessly provision storage while growing your applications by adding virtual servers and EVAs dynamically.\n• EVA virtualization allows you to use the power and speed of all your drives by spreading data across all the disks in the storage array.\n• Remove the guesswork from your purchasing decisions. No need to purchase disks that would be allocated but not in use. The flexibility of EVA virtualization allows you to grow or shrink your storage dynamically as your business needs change.\nEVA uses all the drives for the highest disk utilization.\nTotal Solutions for Your Environment\n• HP offers total solutions for your datacenter, including servers, EVAs, array integrated software, services and support for iSCSI, file and print, backup with Virtual Library System (VLS), data migration with SAN Virtualization Services Platform (SVSP).\n• Integration of applications and operating systems with tested and proven solutions brings simplicity to your complex and changing environment.\n• HP Factory Express can configure your entire order (SAN/POS/servers/backup) in a rack, AND securely load your data prior to shipment saving time and money by providing a fully configured greener solution."},{"type":"html","html":"<p><strong>HP StorageWorks 6400/8400 Enterprise Virtual Array – Specifications and Warranty<br>\n</strong></p>"},{"type":"quote","text":"Ideal For\nBusiness critical enterprise customers who need highly available storage and want to make efficient use of valuable IT staff, resources and budget\nDrive Description\n(324) Fibre Channel/FATA/SSD\nSupported\nCapacity\n324 TB\nMaximum, depending on model\nHost Interface\n4 Gb/sec Fibre Channel (4) Ports per controller\nType and Number of Disk Enclosures\n(27) M6412A\nMaximum, depending on model\nDrives per Enclosure\n12\nMaximum\nServers Supported\nHP Servers (HP-UX, ProLiant, AlphaServers)\nX86 Servers\nDell Servers\nSun Servers\nIBM Servers\nApple Mac OS X Servers (PowerPC and Intel)\nFujitsu Siemens & Primergy Servers\nMaximum, depending on model\nCache\n22 GB\nMaximum, depending on model\nStorage Controller\n(2) HSV400 or HSV450\nDepending on model\nSupported Operating Systems\nHP-UX\nHP OpenVMS\nWindows 2003\nWindows Server 2008\nSun Solaris\nLinux – Red Hat, SuSE/SLES (including OES) and Oracle Enterprise Linux\nIBM AIX\nVMware\nApple Mac OS X\nXen – Citrix Xen, RHEL Virtualization and Oracle Virtual Machine\nAvailability\nDual redundant controllers, hot pluggable power supplies, fans, power distribution units, cache batteries, I/O modules, environmental monitoring units, disks\nWarranty (parts-labor-onsite)\n3/3/3"}]'::jsonb,
  NULL, 'csayantan', '{}'::text[], '{}'::text[], '{"title":"HP StorageWork EVA 8400","description":"Overview Overview Want to tune your storage for the most visible applications in your complex enterprise environment? EVA provides designed-in virtualization…","canonical":"https://cadentic.dev/storage/managing-and-configuring-hp-storagework-eva-8400","noindex":false}'::jsonb, 'draft', NULL,
  '2011-06-08T11:37:30Z'::timestamptz, 'wordpress', '414', now(), now()
